(NULL, 'salary_certificate', 'Salary Certificate', E'NIKKI TECHNOLOGIES\nHyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nDate: {{today}}\n\nTO WHOMSOEVER IT MAY CONCERN\n\nSALARY CERTIFICATE\n\nThis is to certify that {{name}} (Employee ID: {{staff_code}}) is employed with Nikki Technologies as {{designation}} in our {{segment}} division since {{joining_date}}.\n\nThe current annual cost to company (CTC) is Rs. {{ctc}}.\n\nEmployment type: {{employment_type}}\n\nThis certificate is issued at the request of the employee for their personal records and for submission to such authority as they may require. It does not constitute a guarantee of continued employment.\n\nFor Nikki Technologies\n\n_______________________\nAuthorised Signatory\n(Company Seal)', false),

