-- 10. Increment / Promotion Letter
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
(NULL, 'increment_letter', 'Increment / Promotion Letter', E'NIKKI TECHNOLOGIES\n\nDate: {{today}}\n\nTo,\n{{name}}\nEmployee ID: {{staff_code}}\n\nSubject: Revision in Compensation / Designation\n\nDear {{name}},\n\nIn recognition of your performance and contribution to Nikki Technologies, we are pleased to inform you of the following revision, effective {{today}}:\n\n  Designation: {{designation}}\n  Division: {{segment}}\n  Revised Annual CTC: Rs. {{ctc}}\n\nA detailed breakdown of your revised salary structure is available in your staff portal.\n\nAll other terms and conditions of your employment remain unchanged.\n\nWe thank you for your efforts and look forward to your continued contribution.\n\nFor Nikki Technologies\n\n_______________________\nAuthorised Signatory', false),

