(NULL, 'experience_letter', 'Experience Letter', E'NIKKI TECHNOLOGIES\nHyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nDate: {{today}}\n\nTO WHOMSOEVER IT MAY CONCERN\n\nEXPERIENCE CERTIFICATE\n\nThis is to certify that {{name}} (Employee ID: {{staff_code}}) was employed with Nikki Technologies from {{joining_date}} to {{exit_date}}.\n\nAt the time of leaving, {{name}} held the position of {{designation}} in our {{segment}} division.\n\nDuring the tenure with us, we found {{name}} to be sincere, hardworking and professional in the conduct of assigned duties.\n\nWe wish {{name}} every success in future endeavours.\n\nFor Nikki Technologies\n\n_______________________\nAuthorised Signatory\n(Company Seal)', false),

