(NULL, 'relieving_letter', 'Relieving Letter', E'NIKKI TECHNOLOGIES\nHyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nDate: {{today}}\n\nTo,\n{{name}}\nEmployee ID: {{staff_code}}\n\nSubject: Relieving Letter\n\nDear {{name}},\n\nThis is to confirm that your resignation from the position of {{designation}} in the {{segment}} division has been accepted, and you have been relieved from the services of Nikki Technologies with effect from the close of business on {{exit_date}}.\n\nWe confirm that you have completed the required handover of responsibilities, returned all Company assets, and that no Company dues remain outstanding against you, except as separately communicated if applicable.\n\nYour full and final settlement will be processed as per Company policy.\n\nWe take this opportunity to thank you for your services and wish you the very best for your future.\n\nFor Nikki Technologies\n\n_______________________\nAuthorised Signatory', false),

