(NULL, 'internship_certificate', 'Internship Certificate', E'NIKKI TECHNOLOGIES\nHyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nDate: {{today}}\n\nTO WHOMSOEVER IT MAY CONCERN\n\nINTERNSHIP CERTIFICATE\n\nThis is to certify that {{name}} successfully completed an internship with Nikki Technologies in our {{segment}} division from {{joining_date}} to {{exit_date}}, in the role of {{designation}}.\n\nDuring the internship, {{name}} was exposed to practical work in the areas relevant to the division and contributed to live assignments under supervision.\n\nWe found {{name}} to be enthusiastic, willing to learn and professional in conduct.\n\nWe wish {{name}} all the best for future studies and career.\n\nFor Nikki Technologies\n\n_______________________\nAuthorised Signatory\n(Company Seal)', false);
